Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.23,0:00:06.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that getup?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The nursery's going on a field trip to pick sweet potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.45,0:00:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where'd you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was in a magazine I saw at the convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All the field workers were dressed like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you picking potatoes or catching bugs!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.89,0:02:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for having us again this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.47,0:02:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pick as many as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.18,0:02:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.79,0:02:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotta carry everything you pick back yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Promise me you'll only pick as much as you can carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Kobato! They're connected!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.65,0:02:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They really are! Now I want to try too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.24,0:02:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oww...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:45.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you're all dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.67,0:02:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.68,0:02:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.41,0:02:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's a little older than anyone from Yomogi...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.48,0:02:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe he's from this farm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, her grandchildren are already in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:16.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.47,0:03:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You live around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.77,0:03:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry it took us so long to realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Was he from the neighborhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.07,0:04:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's clean up and head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You picked so many!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.42,0:04:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.26,0:04:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I tried my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.62,0:04:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.90,0:04:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotta carry everything you pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.55,0:04:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, we're roasting them when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.63,0:04:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You gonna be okay, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can we help?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine! I'll carry them myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.04,0:04:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't do it. Let us help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.32,0:04:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! I promised I'd do it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.29,0:04:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're such a meanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't do it. Give up, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me lend a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are they done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's smoky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.53,0:05:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful, okay? It's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:41.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do we do with these?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.37,0:05:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we cook more?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.57,0:05:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's share them with the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.57,0:06:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, take Kobato along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.39,0:06:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd rather go alone. It'll be quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, you should go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want her to get to know the neighbors better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.49,0:06:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.24,0:06:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't make you help. Just stay out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.57,0:06:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But they're my sweet potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.47,0:06:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's such a meanie. Always telling me to stay out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he didn't tell you not to follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.87,0:06:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he took my sweet potatoes! I was hoping for leftovers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.07,0:06:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't they heavy? It's more like he's carrying them for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.49,0:07:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.76,0:07:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're from Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.85,0:07:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We went picking tasty sweet potatoes, and now we have plenty to share!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my. Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.83,0:07:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're from Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have some sweet potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.99,0:07:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're from Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.23,0:07:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're almost done!{fff killing nuance fuck nuance}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.12,0:07:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.32,0:07:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's you! It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:07:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How have you been doing, Milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotten bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.02,0:08:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, she has.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.72,0:08:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's been doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, him. He came by and asked for some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He said he'd picked some sweet potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're that kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said, hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me go, you thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's my line, you potato thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.79,0:08:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.77,0:08:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm bringing this thief to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! Lemme go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a runaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.23,0:09:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A runaway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, keeping quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.92,0:09:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just call him "potato thief".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.89,0:09:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a potato thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.95,0:09:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have a name, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.10,0:10:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you run away from home, Keita?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to go to my old house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your old home?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The house I used to live at.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:12.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom got a new job, so we had to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.89,0:10:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So did you go yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.84,0:10:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I want to, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.79,0:10:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You forgot where it is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.51,0:10:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.62,0:10:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You sure look like you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.20,0:10:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You wouldn't forget where your home is, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.82,0:10:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just haven't been there since kindergarten...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't quite remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That means you forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.22,0:10:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't forgotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.97,0:10:58.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.31,0:11:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we don't know what kind of house it is, we can't help you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.22,0:11:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you draw it for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It had a red roof, and windows here and here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.24,0:11:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There was an antenna here, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you draw things that were nearby, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.73,0:11:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That'll make it easier to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.29,0:11:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There was a mailbox here, and a dog lived next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a big dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He always barked when I walked by.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.05,0:12:00.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, and Mom was always baking something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.04,0:12:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She read to me, and on days off we went to the park or camping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.32,0:12:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:28.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna go back to my old home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.42,0:12:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.06,0:12:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna help Keita find his home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be tough to find just looking for a dog and a mailbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.93,0:12:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you remember anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.59,0:13:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Which way? Right or left?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.20,0:13:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.55,0:13:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know where I am now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.72,0:13:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. We must be getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.63,0:13:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you happy, Keita?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.01,0:14:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you thirsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have to be thrifty!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thrifty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a big word for someone your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.95,0:14:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom says it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.37,0:14:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.68,0:14:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.98,0:14:31.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pears, can't you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.90,0:14:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll leave these.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.39,0:14:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See, he's not all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.67,0:14:56.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.57,0:14:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, give me a pear too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.75,0:15:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's this dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.87,0:15:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's gotta be around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.01,0:15:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.93,0:15:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.41,0:16:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My room...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.13,0:16:20.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.45,0:16:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like we have to bust in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.79,0:16:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't break it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:41.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you want to go back home?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.74,0:16:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.95,0:16:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.19,0:16:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom and I live at Grandpa's now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.72,0:16:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita, do you hate your grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.06,0:17:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.23,0:17:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.97,0:17:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.74,0:17:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He always bugs me to get up in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.84,0:17:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Keita! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.03,0:17:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Make your bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.39,0:17:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to stay up later watching TV and playing games.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.54,0:17:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.52,0:17:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing, Grandpa!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop hanging around and go to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At meals, he always wants me to eat things I hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.54,0:17:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Things you hate?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like veggies and fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.24,0:17:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.91,0:17:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop playing with your food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he really being mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! He hates me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.29,0:17:58.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's always scolding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'd rather run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.85,0:18:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I don't wanna...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.20,0:18:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.30,0:18:14.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka always tells the kids at the nursery to eat their fish and veggies because they're nutritious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.04,0:18:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.69,0:18:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's the teacher at Yomogi Nursery. She's kind and loves kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:26.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should go to bed after you bathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he really mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.21,0:19:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm sure if we take a closer look, we'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita, were you going to roast sweet potatoes here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.10,0:19:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We used to all do it together here. They were tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.98,0:19:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should man up and bring these home with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.23,0:19:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I already apologized to the farmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.53,0:19:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She dug up so many that we have leftovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.94,0:19:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See, Keita, it all worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.69,0:19:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you make it back alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.80,0:19:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you I'd be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.45,0:19:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita! {what the christ is a 24-hour TJ Maxx doing anywhere, never mind in my Kobato}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.93,0:20:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.69,0:20:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.83,0:20:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.99,0:20:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:27.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.47,0:20:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.40,0:20:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.79,0:20:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.29,0:20:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell are you doing, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.55,0:20:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit making me worried, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.24,0:20:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your mom's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.64,0:20:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.07,0:21:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keita met his grandpa, and they're getting on the train now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.51,0:21:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No problem. Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.10,0:21:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, you knew Keita's phone number?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.37,0:21:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you call his grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.95,0:21:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.06,0:21:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go home and steam these potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.16,0:21:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.46,0:21:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:32.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.95,0:21:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Domoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You heading home?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.54,0:21:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got something to do, so I'm going straight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.26,0:21:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Something to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.79,0:21:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The nursery went sweet potato picking today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.08,0:21:47.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then we gave out the extras to the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's really a nice guy, isn't he.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:22:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Kiyokazu's a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.78,0:22:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This must be from that brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.82,0:22:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He seemed sad seeing his old house.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Must be because he found out how his grandpa really felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.25,0:22:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.42,0:22:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, Fujimoto tried hard today.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.04,0:22:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You each did half, so 50 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.56,0:22:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But he was a meanie all morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.30,0:22:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.49,0:22:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That puts him at zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you tried hard, so 70 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.04,0:22:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you erase the other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.46,0:22:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You sure do love to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.55,0:22:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was right, you did half so your get 50 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.53,0:22:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, erase it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.37,0:22:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up! 25 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.18,0:22:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, aren't you happy yet? 12.5 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:22:59.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My face is covered in ink...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:38.76,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:47.06,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:56.86,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.37,0:01:02.66,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.66,0:01:10.42,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:16.09,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.09,0:01:21.31,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.31,0:01:27.60,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:33.28,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.28,0:01:39.99,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.99,0:01:48.71,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.47,0:02:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}... Searching at Sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.56,0:23:07.74,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.41,0:23:15.24,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.83,0:23:23.25,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:31.89,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:42.90,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.27,0:23:45.61,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.15,0:23:54.03,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.03,0:24:01.12,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.92,0:24:10.63,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.72,0:24:14.80,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.51,0:24:27.94,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.94,0:24:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(458,388)}... Secret Wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.94,0:24:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(456,116)}Next episode
